      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Karunakara Perumal\nThayaar: Padmamani Thayaar\nVimanam: Vamana Vimanam\nPushkarani: Akraya Theertham\n\nAzhwar Pasuram: \nTirumangai Azhwar: 1 pasuram",
